WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:34.960 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 32=

01:38.560 --> 01:39.799
Hurry up.

01:41.760 --> 01:42.599
I'm lighting it.

01:48.719 --> 01:49.799
Lately,

01:49.799 --> 01:51.079
Mr. Zhao and Madam,

01:51.159 --> 01:52.319
one stays in the side room,

01:52.319 --> 01:53.439
the other in the study.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.079
They don't even look at each other.

01:56.280 --> 01:57.439
If this goes on,

01:57.760 --> 01:59.159
even the closest couple

01:59.159 --> 02:00.120
will drift apart.

02:00.239 --> 02:00.959
Right.

02:01.159 --> 02:02.439
We should find a way

02:02.640 --> 02:04.079
to get them talking

02:04.079 --> 02:04.760
over the New Year's Eve dinner.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.680
In my hometown,

02:07.680 --> 02:08.400
there is a tradition.

02:08.840 --> 02:11.039
Whoever gets the dumpling with the coin

02:11.240 --> 02:12.120
will have everyone

02:12.120 --> 02:13.759
say a few words of blessing to them.

02:14.199 --> 02:16.560
If Madam gets that dumpling...

02:16.879 --> 02:17.680
Good idea.

02:17.759 --> 02:19.199
You're full of good ideas.

02:19.599 --> 02:20.159
Sen.

02:20.159 --> 02:20.919
Get a coin.

02:20.919 --> 02:21.360
Alright.

02:21.639 --> 02:23.800
This is our first New Year
in the capital.

02:24.039 --> 02:25.319
Even though we're in mourning,

02:25.319 --> 02:26.479
and the filling is vegetarian,

02:26.639 --> 02:27.840
let's still make it special

02:27.840 --> 02:28.759
and lively.

02:28.879 --> 02:30.840
The Fifth Madam will be happy
watching from above.

02:31.120 --> 02:31.639
Yes.

02:38.960 --> 02:39.759
But Sanniang,

02:40.199 --> 02:41.280
how do we tell

02:41.280 --> 02:42.080
that dumpling

02:42.080 --> 02:43.120
from the rest?

02:44.199 --> 02:45.680
I will pinch eighteen pleats

02:45.919 --> 02:47.000
on this one dumpling.

02:47.240 --> 02:48.560
Eighteen pleats is good.

02:48.800 --> 02:49.639
The more pleats,

02:49.639 --> 02:50.680
the more blessings.

02:54.280 --> 02:55.199
Lately, Madam

02:55.199 --> 02:56.280
has been upset.

02:57.039 --> 02:58.360
If she gets this dumpling,

02:58.639 --> 03:00.080
her luck will turn next year,

03:00.080 --> 03:01.159
and all will be well.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.319
The dumplings are here.

03:15.240 --> 03:17.159
Today's dumplings are special.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.960
I've hidden a little fortune inside.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.599
Whoever finds it

03:20.599 --> 03:21.599
will have everyone

03:21.599 --> 03:23.080
say a few words of blessing.

03:23.080 --> 03:24.280
Let's see who's the lucky one.
All right?

03:24.280 --> 03:25.080
Yes, that's great.

03:27.400 --> 03:28.240
You have this bowl.

03:30.080 --> 03:32.439
This bowl was prepared
by Mr. Zhao himself.

03:32.439 --> 03:33.680
They're all at the bottom.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.120
It's definitely in this bowl.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.120
Let's eat.

03:37.120 --> 03:37.599
Eat up.

03:37.599 --> 03:38.599
Come on, eat.

03:39.199 --> 03:39.680
Try some.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.319
So good.

03:40.800 --> 03:41.400
Mine is great.

03:42.919 --> 03:44.439
Eat the dumplings first.

03:44.439 --> 03:45.400
Eat up.

03:45.439 --> 03:45.919
Here.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.120
Did you get it?

03:48.400 --> 03:49.439
Not yet.

03:49.439 --> 03:50.360
Me neither.

03:50.439 --> 03:51.159
Not me.

03:53.159 --> 03:54.639
I don't really have much of an appetite.

03:55.240 --> 03:56.680
I'll just go through the motions.

03:56.919 --> 03:58.680
You've lost weight lately.

03:58.759 --> 03:59.800
Have a few more.

03:59.800 --> 04:00.599
The next one

04:00.599 --> 04:02.039
is bound to have it.

04:02.039 --> 04:02.800
Yes, Madam Zhao.

04:02.800 --> 04:03.319
Exactly.

04:03.319 --> 04:03.840
That's right.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.400
Have some more.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.080
Have some more.

04:05.319 --> 04:06.280
It'll come.

04:06.280 --> 04:06.759
Come on.

04:06.759 --> 04:07.400
Eat a few.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.199
Let's eat too.

04:08.199 --> 04:08.719
Eat up.

04:08.719 --> 04:09.319
Come on, eat.

04:09.319 --> 04:11.039
The filling is so good today.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.199
Delicious.

04:13.000 --> 04:13.360
Good.

04:15.599 --> 04:16.800
Whose bowl is it in?

04:16.800 --> 04:17.480
Eat up.

04:17.879 --> 04:19.199
I can't eat anymore.

04:28.879 --> 04:29.720
Come on, have some more.

04:30.279 --> 04:31.160
That works too.

04:31.720 --> 04:33.079
If Mr. Zhao gets it, it's the same.

04:33.079 --> 04:33.439
Right.

04:33.439 --> 04:34.279
We'll all,

04:34.279 --> 04:35.120
including Madam,

04:35.319 --> 04:36.319
especially you,

04:36.319 --> 04:37.160
say a few words of blessing

04:37.160 --> 04:38.199
to Mr. Zhao.

04:38.360 --> 04:38.959
Right.

04:38.959 --> 04:39.839
Yes.

04:43.199 --> 04:43.879
Mr. Zhao.

04:57.199 --> 04:57.839
Eat up.

04:57.839 --> 04:58.879
We'll eat too.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.480
Let's see who gets the lucky one.

05:19.079 --> 05:19.639
Mr. Zhao.

05:19.639 --> 05:20.160
Mr. Zhao.

05:20.160 --> 05:20.560
Mr. Zhao.

05:49.600 --> 05:50.879
Do you regret it?

06:08.759 --> 06:10.199
Regret marrying me?

06:21.759 --> 06:23.560
I regret pushing you to join the army.

06:32.439 --> 06:33.920
Back then,

06:37.040 --> 06:38.720
all I saw was wealth and status.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.480
I was desperate to climb higher.

06:45.720 --> 06:47.279
Then I came to my senses.

06:48.680 --> 06:49.879
I let it go.

06:51.160 --> 06:52.879
But you picked it up again

06:53.160 --> 06:54.199
and couldn't let it go.

06:59.319 --> 07:01.439
If I could go back seven years,

07:02.680 --> 07:05.079
I would want us to share
life and death together.

07:05.959 --> 07:06.720
Maybe

07:09.240 --> 07:11.759
that would be better
than being strangers now.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.480
You want me to climb higher,

07:18.800 --> 07:20.319
but you're afraid that once I become
a powerful minister,

07:20.319 --> 07:21.360
I'll come to no good end.

07:22.639 --> 07:23.560
Quanhui,

07:24.279 --> 07:26.439
nothing is ever perfect in this world.

07:38.000 --> 07:40.040
I don't ask you to trust me or help me.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.720
I only ask that you not grow cold
or leave me.

07:48.240 --> 07:50.439
I've already lost too much
along this road.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.439
I don't want to lose you.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.360
It is cold at the top.

08:13.399 --> 08:15.439
Now I finally understand.

08:18.199 --> 08:19.480
This power

08:21.319 --> 08:22.439
has turned Zhao Ling

08:23.120 --> 08:24.480
into General Zhao,

08:26.319 --> 08:27.600
and Fu Tingyun

08:28.720 --> 08:30.319
into Madam Zhao.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.000
Mr. Zhao,

08:46.960 --> 08:49.000
what can I do

08:50.440 --> 08:51.559
to make you

08:51.559 --> 08:53.360
feel more alive?

09:12.840 --> 09:14.679
If being with me

09:17.039 --> 09:18.399
makes you feel stifled

09:19.480 --> 09:20.480
and in pain,

09:27.679 --> 09:28.600
then perhaps

09:32.600 --> 09:33.919
we should end our marriage.

09:45.120 --> 09:48.960
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

09:51.840 --> 09:56.480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

09:56.480 --> 09:58.120
If you don't want to see me,

09:59.559 --> 10:00.279
tonight

10:01.799 --> 10:03.120
I'll stay at the yamen.

10:04.279 --> 10:04.919
You...

10:07.600 --> 10:13.320
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

10:14.080 --> 10:15.360
Don't let your mind wander.

10:15.520 --> 10:17.560
♪I turn away♪

10:17.560 --> 10:23.160
♪Afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

10:23.160 --> 10:26.160
♪Etched deep within my heart♪

10:26.160 --> 10:30.720
♪Yet buried without a word♪

10:30.720 --> 10:34.680
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

10:34.680 --> 10:39.320
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

10:39.320 --> 10:44.560
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

10:47.520 --> 10:49.520
♪I turn away♪

10:49.520 --> 10:55.280
♪Afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

10:55.280 --> 10:58.280
♪If we can build our future together♪

10:58.280 --> 11:02.560
♪No storm can chill my heart♪

11:02.560 --> 11:06.560
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

11:06.560 --> 11:11.120
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

11:11.120 --> 11:16.840
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

11:34.559 --> 11:36.039
If Lord Liu

11:36.120 --> 11:37.440
of the Ministry of Personnel

11:37.440 --> 11:39.080
had not intercepted that petition today,

11:39.639 --> 11:42.080
I would still be in the dark.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.639
You had the nerve
to go behind the family's back

11:46.360 --> 11:47.679
and secretly

11:48.159 --> 11:50.840
secure a post in Ganlin on your own!

12:00.399 --> 12:01.559
Now, I am

12:03.440 --> 12:04.720
under a lot of criticism.

12:05.720 --> 12:08.159
Even this
lowly seventh-rank clerk position

12:08.840 --> 12:10.559
came through the help of my peers

12:11.279 --> 12:13.320
with great effort.

12:14.279 --> 12:15.559
Only because no one noticed

12:15.559 --> 12:16.919
could it be done.

12:18.120 --> 12:18.879
Father,

12:20.759 --> 12:21.679
I can no longer

12:21.679 --> 12:23.559
achieve anything in the capital.

12:25.039 --> 12:26.320
Let me go to Ganlin.

12:26.799 --> 12:27.440
At least...

12:28.679 --> 12:30.919
At least I can see the desert's view.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.039
Nonsense!

12:32.480 --> 12:33.960
What are you talking about?

12:35.919 --> 12:36.639
Master.

12:36.799 --> 12:38.200
You're my son.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.279
A top scholar personally appointed
by His Majesty.

12:40.399 --> 12:41.320
You want to go to the border

12:41.320 --> 12:42.840
and serve as a lowly clerk.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.399
Where does that leave my dignity?

12:44.559 --> 12:44.919
Master.

12:44.919 --> 12:46.399
Do you want the entire court

12:46.480 --> 12:48.120
to laugh at the Yu family?

12:48.120 --> 12:49.159
That's enough, Master.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.320
I know you're upset.

12:55.960 --> 12:56.879
But for now,

12:57.360 --> 12:58.720
with so many household matters,

12:58.720 --> 12:59.799
you just need to wait a little longer.

13:00.200 --> 13:02.159
He will surely lead you
to a life of prosperity and honor.

13:19.120 --> 13:20.279
I have been unfilial.

13:24.080 --> 13:24.679
But about Ganlin...

13:24.679 --> 13:25.480
No buts!

13:31.320 --> 13:32.000
Quickly.

13:32.919 --> 13:34.600
Help Young Master back to his room.

13:35.159 --> 13:35.639
Hurry.

13:38.679 --> 13:39.360
Young Master,

13:39.879 --> 13:41.000
let's go back and rest.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.200
Let's go back and rest.

13:52.679 --> 13:54.919
Useless wretch.

13:58.279 --> 13:59.320
Rest assured, Master.

13:59.720 --> 14:01.320
Leave this to me.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.279
I will set things right.

14:46.879 --> 14:48.000
I never thought

14:48.840 --> 14:50.559
you would seek a post on your own.

14:50.639 --> 14:51.639
And even more so,

14:51.639 --> 14:53.240
that you would want to go so far away.

14:56.000 --> 14:57.679
If you truly get posted to Ganlin,

14:59.799 --> 15:00.919
take me with you.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.159
Is that okay?

15:06.480 --> 15:07.840
Maybe a change of place

15:09.759 --> 15:11.799
would make us happier than we are
in the capital.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.200
Perhaps,

15:22.399 --> 15:23.799
in time,

15:26.799 --> 15:29.120
we could mend the rift between us.

15:29.679 --> 15:31.600
We could live like ordinary couples

15:33.600 --> 15:35.240
and lead an ordinary life.

15:35.720 --> 15:36.440
Would that be good?

15:44.360 --> 15:46.320
Ganlin is a place of endless sand
and dust.

15:47.799 --> 15:49.559
Even a sip of clean water is hard
to come by.

15:51.279 --> 15:53.279
You have lived in comfort
for so many years.

15:55.039 --> 15:56.120
Can you bear it?

16:04.480 --> 16:06.879
Back then, you sought wealth
and status through me.

16:09.399 --> 16:11.919
Now, you seek freedom through me.

16:12.720 --> 16:13.639
Young Madam,

16:15.000 --> 16:17.200
once you have dreamed
of such splendor and wealth,

16:19.320 --> 16:20.679
do not wake up from it.

16:23.120 --> 16:25.320
And do not think of leaving the capital
this way.

16:29.399 --> 16:30.440
In your eyes,

16:32.080 --> 16:33.600
is that who I truly am?

16:34.799 --> 16:36.120
You went to great lengths

16:36.120 --> 16:37.720
to marry into a family like ours.

16:38.559 --> 16:40.120
Now you have Ji as well.

16:41.440 --> 16:43.279
Even if I die in Ganlin tomorrow,

16:45.279 --> 16:46.320
your food, clothing, and daily comforts

16:46.320 --> 16:47.600
will not decrease one bit.

16:48.840 --> 16:49.799
For the rest of your life,

16:50.159 --> 16:51.039
wherever I am,

16:51.679 --> 16:53.879
your wealth and glory
will not be affected.

17:09.559 --> 17:12.559
How can anyone be so heartless
to the one sleeping beside them?

17:26.440 --> 17:28.359
After over a decade of hard study,

17:28.680 --> 17:30.480
you finally passed the imperial exam
with top honors,

17:32.039 --> 17:33.480
and entered the Hanlin Academy.

17:34.440 --> 17:35.920
You are only going through
a rough patch,

17:36.039 --> 17:37.839
and have encountered some difficulties.

17:38.400 --> 17:40.640
And now you want to throw away
your bright future

17:41.680 --> 17:44.000
and go suffer in that desolate place.

17:44.839 --> 17:46.039
Why?

17:46.200 --> 17:47.319
Mother, please say no more.

17:48.559 --> 17:50.200
My mind is made up.

17:53.119 --> 17:54.119
All right.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.039
I know

17:59.279 --> 18:01.119
why you insist on going to Ganlin.

18:02.640 --> 18:03.839
You may leave.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.680
But after you go,

18:08.440 --> 18:10.680
are you not afraid
that I will move against Fu Tingyun?

18:14.400 --> 18:16.400
She is now an imperially titled lady

18:16.400 --> 18:17.640
of the second rank.

18:18.720 --> 18:19.720
"Imperial titled"?

18:23.200 --> 18:25.240
A bowl of wonton can be poisoned.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.839
She can be attacked on the street.

18:29.079 --> 18:30.880
Even if she never leaves her house,

18:31.559 --> 18:33.680
I can bribe a servant to drug her.

18:33.880 --> 18:36.400
I have a thousand ways to end her,

18:39.000 --> 18:41.440
and ten thousand ways to escape blame.

18:44.720 --> 18:46.440
If you dare to leave,

18:48.119 --> 18:49.759
for the rest of my life,

18:50.559 --> 18:52.319
I will fight her to the death.

18:58.000 --> 18:59.799
A son knows his mother best.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.160
You know well

19:03.920 --> 19:05.559
what I am capable of.

19:16.160 --> 19:18.440
Mother, are you willing to cast aside

19:18.440 --> 19:19.359
even the last bond between us?

19:20.039 --> 19:21.640
The bond is still there.

19:22.279 --> 19:23.839
But now that my own child

19:23.839 --> 19:25.200
is about to abandon me,

19:25.640 --> 19:28.000
I can no longer hold on to it.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.799
What a perfectly matched couple
you two are.

19:39.920 --> 19:41.319
One uses me.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.440
The other threatens me.

20:13.079 --> 20:14.640
If Young Master insists on leaving

20:14.640 --> 20:15.799
and takes you with him,

20:15.799 --> 20:17.640
how will we ever get away?

20:18.359 --> 20:19.200
Don't worry.

20:20.279 --> 20:21.640
We won't be going there.

20:31.720 --> 20:32.680
Young Master, you're here.

20:32.759 --> 20:33.960
Light day at the office?

20:54.119 --> 20:55.640
This hairpin is a bit old.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.440
If you want one,

20:57.640 --> 20:59.400
I'll have Cairong get you a new one.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.200
I want this one.

21:12.039 --> 21:12.960
Madam.

21:13.799 --> 21:15.039
Why would Concubine Wu

21:15.359 --> 21:17.480
suddenly ask to see you?

21:19.680 --> 21:21.880
After what happened
with Madam Wu's records,

21:22.640 --> 21:24.640
I still owe her a favor.

21:25.720 --> 21:26.880
I'm afraid

21:28.319 --> 21:29.319
I have to go.

21:31.400 --> 21:34.280
(Three days later, at the Wei Hour,
the teahouse in the south of the city.)

21:36.600 --> 21:42.480
(Mingxiang Teahouse)

22:19.559 --> 22:20.240
Madam.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.240
Ninth Young Lady.

22:32.680 --> 22:33.440
I know

22:34.039 --> 22:35.200
you are not happy now.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.359
If you need to,

22:37.960 --> 22:38.880
you can come with me.

22:40.440 --> 22:41.480
I will take you back to Ganlin.

22:45.599 --> 22:46.680
In Huaying,

22:47.440 --> 22:49.400
you framed me for adultery.

22:50.240 --> 22:51.319
In Ganlin,

22:51.799 --> 22:53.759
you accused Mr. Zhao and me of eloping.

22:55.839 --> 22:56.960
And now,

22:57.079 --> 22:58.240
you are doing

22:58.240 --> 22:59.960
what you once condemned most.

23:02.759 --> 23:03.440
Lord Yu,

23:03.960 --> 23:05.359
why can't you leave me alone?

23:06.440 --> 23:08.200
I only want to help set you free.

23:09.839 --> 23:10.720
I meant no offense.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.680
Lord Yu, show some restraint.

23:12.799 --> 23:14.079
I am already married.

23:14.480 --> 23:15.880
And you are a man of official standing.

23:16.440 --> 23:18.119
For someone of your status
to behave so shamelessly

23:18.119 --> 23:19.119
and cling to me like this,

23:19.440 --> 23:21.480
how are you any different
from a common ruffian?

23:23.039 --> 23:24.759
It was precisely because I cared
too much about status back then

23:26.119 --> 23:27.440
that I hesitated to fight for you.

23:28.799 --> 23:30.200
And that is why I lost you.

23:31.839 --> 23:32.559
But now,

23:33.640 --> 23:35.319
I have let go of all those vain titles.

23:36.000 --> 23:37.279
Status, rank,

23:38.480 --> 23:39.599
fame and fortune,

23:40.920 --> 23:42.119
compared to you,

23:42.119 --> 23:43.079
they mean nothing.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.200
If you are willing,

23:48.079 --> 23:49.319
I will give up everything.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.680
All these pleas you keep making to me,

23:53.839 --> 23:55.359
they are really for yourself.

23:56.759 --> 23:57.720
Your pain,

23:57.720 --> 23:58.559
your struggles.

23:58.720 --> 23:59.839
Your feelings for me are an obsession,

23:59.839 --> 24:00.720
not love.

24:01.160 --> 24:02.680
You are trapped in your own cage.

24:02.680 --> 24:04.039
What does that have to do with me?

24:04.759 --> 24:06.319
If you want to escape,

24:06.319 --> 24:07.720
do not use me as your excuse.

24:09.480 --> 24:10.000
No.

24:11.359 --> 24:11.839
No.

24:14.279 --> 24:15.359
You have misunderstood me.

24:17.000 --> 24:18.759
This time, I am truly determined.

24:20.279 --> 24:20.960
Ninth Young Lady.

24:21.799 --> 24:22.480
What are you doing?

24:22.480 --> 24:23.240
Let go!

24:23.240 --> 24:24.119
Let go!

24:24.119 --> 24:24.720
Let go!

24:24.720 --> 24:25.480
Let go!

24:26.599 --> 24:27.359
Sanniang.

24:45.960 --> 24:48.160
I will never leave you alone
in the capital.

24:50.759 --> 24:51.960
You cannot win against them.

25:01.759 --> 25:02.599
Young Madam.

25:03.359 --> 25:05.680
If it were not for Young Master's
reputation and future,

25:05.759 --> 25:06.440
this small matter

25:06.440 --> 25:08.440
would never have come before you

25:08.440 --> 25:09.480
to trouble you.

25:10.559 --> 25:12.039
Yesterday, I overheard

25:12.319 --> 25:13.799
that Young Master
has taken a new concubine.

25:14.079 --> 25:16.000
He has bought a fine house
to settle her in.

25:16.279 --> 25:17.279
If you do not believe me,

25:17.480 --> 25:18.680
just follow Chengxin.

25:18.680 --> 25:19.720
You will see for yourself.

25:22.799 --> 25:24.119
Now that I can accept you,

25:24.880 --> 25:26.319
then I can accept another concubine.

25:29.599 --> 25:31.079
Why tell me all this?

25:31.759 --> 25:33.119
Are you trying to use me

25:33.400 --> 25:34.759
to win back Young Master's heart?

25:36.240 --> 25:38.440
I only want what is best for his career.

25:39.160 --> 25:39.880
I've known it.

25:40.599 --> 25:41.640
You may go.

25:46.039 --> 25:47.000
My Lady.

25:47.720 --> 25:50.039
If you ask Young Madam
to step in and save her,

25:50.119 --> 25:51.559
and this blows up,

25:51.559 --> 25:53.160
it will not go well for you.

25:54.119 --> 25:55.440
I must save her.

25:56.359 --> 25:57.440
But I must also stop him

25:57.559 --> 25:58.599
from leaving for Ganlin on his own.

25:59.359 --> 26:00.440
Otherwise, I am afraid

26:01.039 --> 26:02.799
I will be sent away by Madam Yu.

26:04.759 --> 26:05.880
I have found out.

26:06.400 --> 26:07.119
She is

26:07.240 --> 26:09.440
in a small courtyard
on Zhenjiang Hutong.

26:09.799 --> 26:11.680
But if you go there
to confront her directly,

26:12.039 --> 26:13.680
you will only make things worse
with Young Master.

26:14.039 --> 26:15.400
Do not act on impulse

26:15.480 --> 26:16.960
and anger him further.

26:17.400 --> 26:19.119
Who said I was going to catch him
in the act?

26:21.480 --> 26:23.440
I will bring her into the household

26:24.640 --> 26:26.079
and make her a concubine as well.

26:27.720 --> 26:29.119
The more chaos in this house,

26:31.240 --> 26:32.559
the happier I will be.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.240
Open the door.

26:39.160 --> 26:40.119
Open the door.

26:43.599 --> 26:44.400
This is the house

26:44.400 --> 26:45.920
where Young Master
has settled his concubine.

26:47.559 --> 26:48.559
Open up!

26:51.799 --> 26:53.400
I am an imperially titled lady
of the second rank.

26:53.799 --> 26:55.440
The wife of General Zhao Huchen.

26:55.960 --> 26:57.200
You are neither bailiffs

26:57.200 --> 26:58.440
nor do you have any official warrant.

26:58.440 --> 26:59.480
How dare you detain me!

26:59.720 --> 27:01.200
I don't care what title you hold.

27:01.279 --> 27:02.720
We only answer to Lord Yu.

27:05.079 --> 27:05.880
Open the door.

27:06.119 --> 27:07.079
The concubine

27:08.359 --> 27:09.400
is her.

27:43.079 --> 27:43.880
Yake.

27:44.720 --> 27:46.359
You must be feeling quite pleased now.

27:47.799 --> 27:48.839
All these years,

27:50.720 --> 27:52.640
his heart has always been with you.

27:53.480 --> 27:54.680
You refused to marry him at first.

27:55.960 --> 27:57.880
Then Madam Yu tried to take you
as a concubine.

27:58.480 --> 27:59.839
Now, after all these twists and turns,

28:00.359 --> 28:01.680
you end up as his mistress.

28:01.799 --> 28:02.799
You're overthinking this.

28:04.279 --> 28:06.400
Ever since the engagement
with the Yu family ended,

28:06.400 --> 28:07.319
our ties were severed.

28:07.960 --> 28:09.400
Whoever Yu Jingxiu holds in his heart

28:09.400 --> 28:10.440
has nothing to do with me.

28:10.839 --> 28:11.759
I don't care either.

28:12.359 --> 28:13.279
What happened today

28:14.960 --> 28:16.200
was as much a surprise to me
as it was to you.

28:18.240 --> 28:20.039
Have you truly never been drawn to him?

28:24.559 --> 28:26.599
To you, Yu Jingxiu is a prize
worth fighting for.

28:26.599 --> 28:27.759
Then hold on to him

28:28.559 --> 28:30.440
and keep him from disturbing my life.

28:32.680 --> 28:33.880
In this life,

28:35.279 --> 28:36.960
if all you do is stare
at other people's paths,

28:38.119 --> 28:40.440
you will never be able
to walk your own well.

28:42.440 --> 28:43.880
All I see and think about

28:45.200 --> 28:47.240
is my own life.

29:01.079 --> 29:02.279
Ever since I was young,

29:05.599 --> 29:06.960
you never even spared a glance

29:09.440 --> 29:11.000
at the things I fought so hard for.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.839
The jewels and finery, the same.

29:16.000 --> 29:17.680
The engagement with the Yu family,
the same.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.400
Yu Jingxiu,

29:20.920 --> 29:21.880
the same.

29:23.400 --> 29:25.000
What I treasured like precious gems,

29:28.119 --> 29:29.559
you threw away like worthless scraps.

29:37.440 --> 29:38.240
Tingyun.

29:41.119 --> 29:42.599
Do you know why your mother

29:44.799 --> 29:46.039
died?

29:50.279 --> 29:51.200
Didn't Mother...

29:55.000 --> 29:56.119
pass away from an illness?

30:04.240 --> 30:06.000
Grand Secretary Yu wanted
to scheme against Zhao Ling.

30:07.599 --> 30:09.039
He started with your father.

30:10.200 --> 30:12.400
The plan was to force Zhao Ling
into three months of mourning.

30:15.319 --> 30:17.400
Madam Yu instigated your father.

30:17.839 --> 30:19.240
He wanted to cling to power,

30:21.839 --> 30:22.960
so he poisoned

30:25.359 --> 30:26.799
the Fifth Madam to death.

30:33.799 --> 30:34.640
Before,

30:36.160 --> 30:38.000
you were trapped in Biyun Nunnery
because of me,

30:40.079 --> 30:41.839
with only a bowl of poison.

30:44.440 --> 30:46.039
Today, I tell you the truth

30:50.039 --> 30:51.720
as my repayment to you.

30:53.920 --> 30:54.960
Make sure

30:56.640 --> 30:58.359
you know who your true enemy is.

31:11.799 --> 31:12.759
Don't worry.

31:14.440 --> 31:16.119
Yu Jingxiu will not take you away.

31:17.599 --> 31:19.240
I no longer care about being

31:20.440 --> 31:21.759
the Young Madam of the Yu family.

31:23.720 --> 31:24.599
But for now,

31:27.160 --> 31:28.559
that title still has its use.

31:35.440 --> 31:35.960
Young Madam.

31:35.960 --> 31:36.400
Calm down.

31:36.880 --> 31:37.559
You must not.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.799
You must not, Young Madam!

31:40.759 --> 31:41.440
Young Madam.

31:41.559 --> 31:42.359
I know

31:43.640 --> 31:45.000
you only listen to him,

31:46.079 --> 31:47.200
not to me.

31:48.319 --> 31:50.440
But if you do not let her go today,

31:50.440 --> 31:51.960
I will kill myself right here!

31:53.000 --> 31:54.680
Do you think you can escape the blame

31:54.759 --> 31:55.960
for driving the Young Madam
to her death?

32:07.279 --> 32:08.000
We will not move.

32:08.000 --> 32:08.559
Young Madam,

32:08.799 --> 32:09.640
please put it down.

32:10.160 --> 32:10.880
Please put it down.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.599
When I woke up,

32:23.839 --> 32:25.680
Madam was already gone.

32:25.680 --> 32:27.000
I rushed home,

32:27.440 --> 32:28.640
sent Sen over here,

32:28.640 --> 32:30.160
then came to find you

32:30.400 --> 32:30.960
- to tell you.
- Chuan.

32:31.079 --> 32:31.599
Mr. Zhao.

32:31.599 --> 32:32.400
Go to the Yu Residence

32:32.839 --> 32:33.960
and gather all the brothers.

32:34.160 --> 32:35.880
Anyone who can provide information
on Madam's whereabouts

32:35.960 --> 32:36.559
will be rewarded.

32:36.559 --> 32:37.079
Mr. Zhao,

32:37.279 --> 32:38.079
I just found out.

32:38.319 --> 32:39.279
A few days ago, Yu Jingxiu

32:39.279 --> 32:40.839
rented a courtyard on Zhenjiang Hutong.

32:41.079 --> 32:42.319
He has been acting suspiciously lately.

32:42.759 --> 32:43.759
Should we go take a look?

33:06.480 --> 33:09.040
♪The faint incense fades from boughs♪

33:10.040 --> 33:12.760
♪Lone wild geese know not
late autumn's woes♪

33:13.800 --> 33:16.560
♪If heaven's will, none can implore♪

33:17.600 --> 33:19.880
♪Mortal world's all absurd lore♪

33:20.920 --> 33:21.559
Tingyun!

33:24.080 --> 33:27.120
♪Cold night asks not
of those who leave or stay♪

33:27.880 --> 33:30.440
♪Trapped in the rain♪

33:31.200 --> 33:34.720
♪Are first to be chilled by the wind♪

33:35.360 --> 33:38.400
♪Fate writes its lines, yet asks no one♪

33:38.400 --> 33:39.240
Mr. Zhao.

33:40.359 --> 33:41.079
Don't be afraid.

33:44.160 --> 33:46.200
♪All is ash upon the altar,
bearing guilt's shame♪

33:46.200 --> 33:51.400
♪Atone for my sin♪

33:55.840 --> 33:59.000
♪Shattered into dust thin♪

34:03.040 --> 34:09.280
♪When the wind blows, I feel no regret♪

34:10.040 --> 34:15.960
♪Right and wrong, I face without fear♪

34:17.760 --> 34:22.200
♪The long road stretches on,
but dawn will come at last♪

34:45.440 --> 34:46.920
This is not the way home.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.559
Where are you taking me?

35:21.440 --> 35:23.079
Our marriage was decreed by His Majesty.

35:25.440 --> 35:27.000
Only death can part us.

35:29.239 --> 35:30.960
But today, there is a chance.

35:32.239 --> 35:33.280
I can report

35:34.039 --> 35:34.800
that

35:37.239 --> 35:38.599
you were taken by kidnappers.

35:39.480 --> 35:40.880
I can use that to send you away

35:41.400 --> 35:43.039
from this place that brings you no joy.

35:43.880 --> 35:44.719
Jiangnan,

35:45.960 --> 35:46.920
Yongning Prefecture,

35:48.800 --> 35:49.639
Ganlin Town.

35:50.840 --> 35:52.119
If you wish to leave,

35:54.920 --> 35:56.280
you can depart tonight.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.280
The house,

36:03.119 --> 36:04.119
silver notes,

36:04.800 --> 36:05.719
horses and carriage,

36:07.639 --> 36:09.559
everything is ready.

36:11.719 --> 36:12.880
I only wish

36:17.159 --> 36:18.639
to give you one more choice.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.159
Quanhui.

36:30.679 --> 36:32.440
I cannot bear to part with you.

36:33.960 --> 36:35.079
But I do not want

36:36.199 --> 36:37.800
you to live in fear for me anymore.

36:38.960 --> 36:40.239
When I married you,

36:41.119 --> 36:42.639
I wanted to give you happiness.

36:44.559 --> 36:45.639
On our wedding day,

36:46.559 --> 36:48.000
I made a promise to your mother.

36:48.079 --> 36:49.679
I know what happened to my mother.

36:51.079 --> 36:51.880
My mother

36:55.000 --> 36:57.480
was killed by the Yu family,
through my father's hands.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.280
You knew all along.

37:05.559 --> 37:07.039
But you would not tell me.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.039
The situation grows more dangerous
by the day.

37:14.440 --> 37:16.280
It would be wiser for you
to part ways with me.

37:22.559 --> 37:24.199
I fear that one day,

37:26.599 --> 37:28.199
I will have to forsake everyone,

37:30.719 --> 37:31.719
including you.

37:45.440 --> 37:47.559
Do you know what a true villain is?

37:49.280 --> 37:50.920
They commit every evil deed,

37:52.440 --> 37:54.119
yet let others take the blame.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.960
You've fallen right into the trap,
Zhao Ling.

37:58.360 --> 38:00.159
If I leave you to face this alone

38:00.679 --> 38:01.960
and just walk away,

38:04.400 --> 38:05.800
I would be unworthy as your wife.

38:11.079 --> 38:12.320
Do you mean

38:16.599 --> 38:17.440
you are not leaving?

38:23.679 --> 38:24.599
Power

38:26.079 --> 38:28.039
turns a man into a blade,

38:28.599 --> 38:29.480
a bow,

38:30.159 --> 38:31.039
a crossbow.

38:33.720 --> 38:39.119
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

38:39.119 --> 38:41.239
But I do not want you to become that.

38:43.800 --> 38:45.440
I want you to always remember

38:46.599 --> 38:48.079
that you are a man.

38:49.440 --> 38:51.199
To your brothers, you are Mr. Zhao,

38:52.079 --> 38:54.159
and to me, you are my husband.

38:56.039 --> 38:57.840
You are nobody's Huchen.

39:00.520 --> 39:04.280
♪I seek nothing beyond the world♪

39:06.560 --> 39:12.520
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

39:14.440 --> 39:15.679
Let's go home.

39:18.520 --> 39:21.080
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

39:21.080 --> 39:26.080
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

39:26.080 --> 39:32.200
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

39:32.200 --> 39:36.400
♪I seek nothing beyond myself♪

39:36.400 --> 39:38.199
I often have nightmares.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.679
I will always be with you.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.440
What do we do now?

39:55.239 --> 39:55.840
Young Master.

39:58.039 --> 39:58.880
What happened?

39:59.639 --> 40:00.079
Well...

40:16.360 --> 40:17.000
Where is she?

40:20.920 --> 40:22.599
Coveting a fellow officer's wife

40:23.960 --> 40:25.400
and abducting her.

40:26.440 --> 40:27.440
I never thought

40:28.800 --> 40:31.239
that you, Young Lord Yu,
would ever want what you cannot have.

40:33.360 --> 40:34.079
Indeed,

40:34.800 --> 40:36.320
a bond forced into being

40:37.440 --> 40:38.639
is always an ill-fated one.

40:38.639 --> 40:39.280
Shut up!

40:39.440 --> 40:40.159
What?

40:40.239 --> 40:41.440
You had the guts to do it,

40:42.440 --> 40:43.800
but you can't stand hearing the truth?

40:48.320 --> 40:50.000
Your behavior now

40:50.840 --> 40:52.400
is no different from a bitter wife's.

40:53.039 --> 40:53.960
Young Master.

40:56.800 --> 40:58.480
I do not know when it started,

40:59.000 --> 40:59.960
but without hating you,

41:01.480 --> 41:03.159
I feel I cannot go on living.

41:04.840 --> 41:06.599
You call me dull and unremarkable.

41:08.760 --> 41:10.679
Drop me in a crowd,
and you'd lose me in a second.

41:14.639 --> 41:15.760
But Young Master,

41:16.119 --> 41:17.679
before I married you,

41:17.679 --> 41:19.719
I was also one of a kind.

41:20.480 --> 41:22.119
You say I am dull,

41:23.400 --> 41:25.320
and that is because you are dull.

41:31.920 --> 41:32.840
Yu Jingxiu.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.840
Even if you had not married me,

41:35.960 --> 41:36.960
but someone else instead,

41:38.760 --> 41:39.920
you would have turned them

41:39.920 --> 41:41.480
into someone just as dull as me.

41:44.440 --> 41:46.199
Your obsession with her now

41:46.559 --> 41:48.679
is no different from the obsession
that made you marry me.

41:49.639 --> 41:51.480
It is all self-deception.

41:52.639 --> 41:53.960
You still want freedom?

41:54.639 --> 41:56.039
You do not deserve it.

42:01.119 --> 42:02.920
You are jealous and immoral.

42:04.159 --> 42:05.440
Your words and actions are reckless.

42:06.679 --> 42:07.800
You have lost your mind.

42:08.079 --> 42:09.880
It seems you no longer want
to go back to this family!

42:16.679 --> 42:17.199
Yes.

42:19.119 --> 42:20.199
You are right.

42:21.239 --> 42:23.159
I have long grown tired

42:23.159 --> 42:24.159
of this heartless family!

42:25.440 --> 42:26.639
In this family,

42:28.280 --> 42:30.239
you answer to Mother's moods.

42:30.239 --> 42:31.920
And Mother answers to Father's.

42:31.920 --> 42:32.599
And me?

42:36.360 --> 42:38.480
I please all of you.

42:40.599 --> 42:41.559
In the end,

42:44.559 --> 42:46.960
I answer to all of your moods.

42:53.079 --> 42:54.280
From this day on,

42:57.400 --> 42:58.800
whether it is love,

42:59.960 --> 43:00.920
power,

43:02.159 --> 43:03.000
or freedom,

43:04.480 --> 43:07.119
I will expect nothing from you.

43:09.079 --> 43:10.440
Young Lord Yu,

43:11.800 --> 43:13.280
watch yourself.

43:32.280 --> 43:34.600
(Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books)

43:43.920 --> 43:45.119
I, Fan Yake,

43:45.719 --> 43:47.000
wish to leave this house

43:48.159 --> 43:49.559
and retreat to the villa
for quiet cultivation.

43:50.639 --> 43:52.039
You truly wish to leave?

43:54.440 --> 43:56.079
Have you not always regretted

43:56.639 --> 43:58.559
not having the daughter-in-law
you wanted?

43:59.440 --> 44:00.480
Now I wish to leave,

44:00.880 --> 44:02.199
you suddenly want me to stay.

44:02.559 --> 44:04.079
Ji is still so young.

44:04.480 --> 44:06.679
Can you bear to let him grow up
without a mother?

44:08.440 --> 44:09.760
In the past,

44:11.840 --> 44:14.199
I might have let that keep me here,

44:15.440 --> 44:16.920
trapped for a lifetime.

44:18.039 --> 44:18.880
But now,

44:19.159 --> 44:20.920
I know what I want.

44:21.360 --> 44:22.400
I do not want to be

44:22.400 --> 44:24.159
a mother bound by her children.

44:24.440 --> 44:25.880
What nonsense are you saying?

44:26.480 --> 44:27.599
You are a mother.

44:27.599 --> 44:28.920
How can you be so willful?

44:28.920 --> 44:29.440
Go.

44:29.440 --> 44:30.440
Bring Ji here.

44:30.480 --> 44:30.960
Yes.

44:30.960 --> 44:31.599
No need.

44:38.840 --> 44:40.079
I have no strength left.

44:41.239 --> 44:43.159
Ji lives in comfort at home,
wanting for nothing.

44:44.000 --> 44:44.960
I have no worries.

44:46.559 --> 44:48.280
If he stays with me,
he will only be burdened.

44:49.039 --> 44:50.960
Think back on your own life, Madam.

44:51.679 --> 44:53.239
Was even a single bit

44:55.599 --> 44:57.599
of what you've done ever for your child?

44:59.039 --> 45:00.639
Since you could not do it yourself,

45:01.039 --> 45:03.239
why ask me to be a devoted mother?

45:15.320 --> 45:17.400
Right now, I value freedom above all.

45:19.079 --> 45:20.920
I only want to live for myself.

45:28.599 --> 45:29.719
Even if you,

45:31.199 --> 45:33.159
and the whole world, call me
an unfit mother,

45:34.880 --> 45:35.880
so what of it?

45:36.719 --> 45:37.440
Madam.

45:41.119 --> 45:43.400
(If a mother spends her life
swallowing every grievance,)

45:44.320 --> 45:45.920
(her children will never be happy.)

45:46.920 --> 45:48.199
(I fear that one day,)

45:48.639 --> 45:50.360
(I too will say those words,)

45:51.280 --> 45:52.360
("I did it all for you.")

45:54.400 --> 45:56.079
(I don't want to be
that kind of mother.)

46:05.960 --> 46:08.360
(Next Episode)

46:08.679 --> 46:10.159
I, Jin Yuanbao, a humble commoner,

46:10.440 --> 46:13.039
hereby accuse
Zhao Ling, General Zhaoyong,

46:13.199 --> 46:14.320
of colluding with merchants,

46:14.440 --> 46:15.679
engaging in illegal salt trading!

46:16.320 --> 46:17.960
In this life,

46:17.960 --> 46:19.280
the more one craves,

46:19.679 --> 46:21.320
(Xie Residence)
the harder the fall when it's lost.

46:21.320 --> 46:21.639
Take it off!

46:21.639 --> 46:22.519
What are you doing?

46:22.920 --> 46:23.719
What are you doing?

46:24.800 --> 46:26.079
Why did you betray Mr. Zhao?

46:26.079 --> 46:26.880
Withdraw the complaint!

46:27.159 --> 46:28.239
They will turn this

46:28.599 --> 46:29.679
into an airtight case.

46:30.039 --> 46:31.199
And let him take the blame.

46:31.679 --> 46:32.400
Zhao Ling

46:32.800 --> 46:34.119
is to be suspended from office
and imprisoned.

46:34.559 --> 46:36.159
Conduct a full
and thorough investigation.

46:51.440 --> 46:55.760
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

46:59.360 --> 47:03.720
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

47:05.840 --> 47:10.480
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

47:10.720 --> 47:13.520
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

47:14.680 --> 47:19.320
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

47:22.520 --> 47:29.360
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

47:30.240 --> 47:36.760
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

47:37.720 --> 47:41.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:41.680 --> 47:45.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:46.160 --> 47:51.840
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

48:03.960 --> 48:07.840
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

48:11.760 --> 48:15.760
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

48:17.480 --> 48:22.160
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

48:22.480 --> 48:25.160
♪Kept close within my heart♪

48:26.240 --> 48:31.080
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

48:34.600 --> 48:41.520
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

48:42.400 --> 48:48.880
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

48:49.760 --> 48:53.280
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

48:53.720 --> 48:58.080
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

48:58.280 --> 49:04.000
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
